    (2109101682588422148, '福建琯溪蜜柚 三红肉', '产地直发 现摘现发', 2109101678394118155, 32.9, 46.4, 240, 93, 'https://agsell-bucket.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/product/image/20261011/9c05e62c412c4e16bffddd7ea5a61f06.jpg', '["https://agsell-bucket.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/product/image/20261011/9c05e62c412c4e16bffddd7ea5a61f06.jpg", "https://agsell-bucket.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/product/image/20261011/13530f57316a4079b2d967ac769f5628.jpg", "https://agsell-bucket.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/product/image/20261011/844c4cbab28149c18ad6cf73899a63fe.jpg"]', '<p>【福建琯溪蜜柚 三红肉】产地直发 现摘现发。产地直采，福建漳州发货，常温避光，保质期 30天。</p><p>采收后 24 小时内预冷分拣，全程冷链/保湿包装，坏果包赔；支持产地溯源批次查询。</p><img src="https://agsell-bucket.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/product/image/20261011/13530f57316a4079b2d967ac769f5628.jpg" style="width:100%;display:block" /><img src="https://agsell-bucket.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/product/image/20261011/844c4cbab28149c18ad6cf73899a63fe.jpg" style="width:100%;display:block" />', '福建漳州', '2026-08-19', '30天', '常温避光', 1, 60, 0),
